    "long_instructions": "## Build Your Web App\r\n\r\n### What to do:\r\nStart building your web app. Use AI to create your HTML and CSS structure and add in your own images to make it come alive! Click this link for an [example website](https://studio.code.org/projects/weblab2/58034262-e51b-4ed2-9981-8cbb0fac3ee2).\r\n\r\n**Focus On:**\r\n- Setting up your main page and linking to other pages.\r\n- Styling your webpage to match your brand kit. Upload your sketches to AI Tutor!\r\n- Adding in custom images and content.\r\n\r\n**Ask AI for help if you get stuck.** ",
